{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"coding_summary\":\"The focused test reproduces the problem before its worker assertions: importing the API triggers default-root migration work. I’m tracing that eager initialization and will make the regression use repository-local temporary paths.\",\"known_risks\":[],\"modified_files\":[],\"plan\":\"Inspect PSC guidance and relevant API/product tests; reproduce the worker regression hang; fix lifecycle ownership within allowed scope; run focused and required API/product tests.\",\"schema_version\":1,\"tests\":[],\"unresolved_issues\":[]}"}}
